script:pre-request {
  // Folder runs skip this external-write call unless the opt-in flags are set (see the admin-static-token folder docs).
  if (bru.getEnvVar("adminStaticAllowWrites") !== "true" || bru.getEnvVar("adminStaticAllowExternal") !== "true") {
    bru.runner.skipRequest();
  }
}

docs {
  `TripResource.estimateTrip` in plutus-java `src/main/java/com/vahn/plutus/operations/controller/TripResource.java:1875`.
  Roles: VAHN_ADMIN, TORG_ADMIN, TRUCK_MANAGER, FUND_MANAGER, ACCOUNTANT.
  Risk: external-write.
  Body: `TripDTO`.
}
